obs Changed the shell helper control to construct a five-tool PATH for its absent-rg probe. It keeps sh, dirname, tr, xargs and external printf; checks exit 127 and the named absence verdict; and runs whether the host supplies rg or not. Updated its witness comment to describe that mechanism.
